{"title":"Cups\/ Mugs","description":"\u003cp\u003e\"Enjoy your favorite peanut butter smoothies, coffees, and shakes in our signature cups.\u003cbr data-start=\"321\" data-end=\"324\"\u003eDesigned for true peanut butter lovers, our cups keep your drinks fresh and fun.\u003cbr data-start=\"404\" data-end=\"407\"\u003eMade with durable materials and cute, peanut-themed designs.\u003cbr data-start=\"467\" data-end=\"470\"\u003eSip your indulgence in style every day!\"\u003c\/p\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"cups","title":"Cups","description":"\u003cp\u003eEnhance the taste of your meals with our Cups butter and margarine. Made from high-quality ingredients, these products provide a rich and creamy flavor to your dishes. With a perfect blend of butter and margarine, your meals will have a perfect balance of taste and nutrition. Try it today and elevate your cooking game.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Indulgent Butters","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46598153175285,"sku":"","price":13.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0748\/7134\/1301\/files\/WhatsAppImage2025-04-29at5.48.51PM_1.jpg?v=1745929360"},{"product_id":"mugs","title":"Mugs","description":"\u003cp\u003eIntroducing our durable, high-quality mugs. Made from premium materials, these mugs are designed to last and keep your beverages at the perfect temperature. With a sleek and elegant design, these mugs are perfect for any beverage and make a great addition to any kitchen.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"Indulgent Butters","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":46598178373877,"sku":"","price":13.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0748\/7134\/1301\/files\/WhatsAppImage2025-04-29at5.48.51PM_2_9c451891-463d-4814-a2e9-331f7bcd353e.jpg?v=1745929826"}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0748\/7134\/1301\/collections\/WhatsAppImage2025-04-29at5.48.51PM_1.jpg?v=1745929475","url":